            "review_text": "Soojin Ng\n2 contributions\n0\nosy atmosphere, Creativity mixologist, Reasonable price, Must try whenever visiting\nNov 2022 • Solo\nI have a trip to Phu Quoc island which was called \"Pearl Island\". Have a lot of good memorable overhere, but the most I remembering was a hidden bar in An Thoi which near the port. When I was here, while I was thinking about what would I take, the Barman (I think?) came cosily and asked for help. He introduced himself first, and gave me some questions like \"How was your days? Which spirits would you like the most? May I make a new one based on your favourite spirits and flavour?\" Hmm something like that. Afterthat he gave me a cocktail which based gin with melon flavour and of couse it was very nice. He introduced this cocktail clearly, and also guided the guest how to use/make it. What a lovely Barman that I had met there. Highly recommend this Bar whenever you have chance to visit. I will be back there soon, Mr. Finn\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2022",
